'''Erika''' (Japanese: '''エリカ''' ''Erika'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=Heal 50 damage from 1 of your {{e|Grass}} Pokémon.
}}

